l, v4.4.1.stable.mono.official\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot v4.6.stable.mono.official\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot doesn't respect the Editor Shortcuts for Freelook Forward/Left/Backwards/Right/Down/Up when you disable game input and override the in-game camera, it always uses WASDEQ.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a simple 3D scene with a camera and a cube so you can see movement\n- Go to Editor Settings -> Shortcuts\n- Replace the bindings for Freelook Forward/Left/Backwards/Right/Down/Up with keys other than WASDQE (like ESDFWR)\n- Run the game\n- Click 3D button to override input\n- Click the Camera button to override the camera\n- Hold right click and try to move with ESDFWR\n- Freelook movement doesn't work properly, keys are still WASDQE\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115982/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeli